{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"“主除子”"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"主除子"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>设 $f$ 是"},{"Local":{"url":"复流形","text":"复流形"}},{"Plain":" $M$ 上的亚纯函数, 除子 $(f)$ 称为主除子 (principal divisor).</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>主除子在除子与"},{"Local":{"url":"线丛","text":"线丛"}},{"Plain":"的对应中对应平凡线丛.</p>\n"}]}}